third_party/monado/ holds unmodified copies of Monado files, except
mercury/hg_hand_size_opt.{hpp,cpp}, whose std::span parameters were changed to
const std::array references for C++17 (marked in each file). compat/ provides
the small subset of Monado's xrt_defines.h, m_api, logging, tracing and time
interfaces those files include. src/ is a port of hg_sync.cpp, hg_model.cpp
and hg_image_distorter.cpp without OpenCV, ONNX Runtime or debug sinks, for
rectified pinhole cameras.

tinyceres (third_party/tinyceres/) is a subset of Ceres Solver, Copyright 2015
Google Inc., under the BSD 3-Clause license in third_party/tinyceres/LICENSE,
as distributed in Monado's src/external/tinyceres.

Eigen 3.3+ is an external header dependency (MPL-2.0) and is not included
here; see docs/model-development/mercury-hand-tracking.md.

The neural networks (grayscale_detection_160x160.onnx,
grayscale_keypoint_jan18.onnx) come from
https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/monado/utilities/hand-tracking-models and are
not included. That repository carries no license file; establish the model
license before distributing converted model artifacts.
